msgid "The OpenTracing shim"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this section, we present an OpenTelemetry library that can smooth the "
"transition by providing access to the legacy OpenTracing API. This can help "
"with the migration of large applications with many manual instrumentation "
"points."
